SDLInvaders: the keys
=====================

Shoot every invader before they shoot you or reach the ground.

  Cursor Left/Right   move the fighter
  Space               fire
  R                   fire a rocket (it flies straight through the invaders)
  S                   fire a seek rocket (it picks an invader)
  B                   fire a bomb (it takes the invaders around too)
  1 - 9               choose a special weapon
  P                   pause, and again to go on
  H                   help
  Q                   quit

The special weapons (R, S, B at the top) come from shooting the special
alien that flies across the top.

The mouse works too: move it left and right, the left button fires and
the right button changes the weapon.

The high scores are kept in the drawer's User/highscores. From a Shell:
  SDLInvaders --nosound   no sound or music
  SDLInvaders --easy      the easier game
  SDLInvaders --fullscreen   a screen of its own (a window is the default)

The keys every AmiCradle game has on Right Amiga (GFOpenUp's SDL2.module):
Right Amiga + F window or full screen, + P pause, + Q quit, + M free the
mouse pointer, + S a screenshot in the drawer's Screenshots, and Help
shows this file.
